<%- include('partials/top') %>

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
    <p class="kicker kicker-center">Pricing</p>
    <h1 class="h-display">Create with Free.<br><em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--accent2)">Unlock everything</em> with Pro.</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Adding a listing — every field of it — is <b>free, forever</b>. FirmLedger Pro is one account-level subscription: you get to <b>view every listing's full details</b>, listings you own get the blue tick, homepage Featured placement and the premium gold badge — <b>plus full REST API access</b> with keys, docs and a playground.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="plan-grid">
      <div class="plan-card rv">
        <h3>Free</h3>
        <p class="plan-price">$0 <small>forever</small></p>
        <ul class="plan-feats">
          <li>Submit a listing with <b>every detail</b> — no paywalled fields</li>
          <li>Basic public company profile</li>
          <li>Moderated approval &amp; IndexNow push</li>
          <li>Category &amp; search ranking</li>
          <li>Verified claim flow</li>
          <li>Company embed badge</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/register">Create free account</a>
      </div>
      <% if (offers.length) { offers.forEach(function (p, i) { %>
      <div class="plan-card plan-pro rv" style="--d:<%= (i + 1) * 60 %>ms">
        <% if (i === 0) { %><div class="plan-flag">POPULAR</div><% } %>
        <h3><%= p.name %></h3>
        <p class="plan-price">$<%= (p.price_cents / 100).toFixed(2) %> <small>/ <%= p.duration_days %> days</small></p>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:13.5px;margin:0 0 .6rem"><%= p.blurb || 'Full FirmLedger Pro access.' %></p>
        <% if (p.duration_days >= 90) { %>
        <p class="fine-print" style="margin:0 0 .4rem;color:var(--ok)">≈ $<%= (p.price_cents / 100 / (p.duration_days / 30)).toFixed(2) %>/mo — vs monthly billing.</p>
        <% } %>
        <ul class="plan-feats">
          <li><b>View every listing's full details</b> — websites, emails, phones, timelines, graphs</li>
          <li><b>Developer API access</b> — REST CRUD endpoints with API-key auth, rate limits, full docs &amp; a live playground</li>
          <li>Blue verified tick on listings you own — everywhere</li>
          <li>Homepage Featured placement for your listings</li>
          <li>Premium gold company badge</li>
          <li>Priority verification &amp; moderation</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%= user ? '/dashboard/upgrade' : '/register' %>"><%= user ? 'Upgrade now' : 'Register & go Pro' %></a>
      </div>
      <% }) } else { %>
      <div class="plan-card rv" style="--d:60ms">
        <h3>Pro offers</h3>
        <p class="plan-price">—</p>
        <p class="muted">No Pro offers configured yet. Check back soon.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/register">Create free account</a>
      </div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-note rv" style="--d:150ms">
      <span class="cn-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>All payments are handled securely by <b>PayPal</b>. Your subscription starts the moment checkout completes — one-time payments paid in advance, no auto-renewal surprises.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section" style="margin-bottom:1.4rem">Pro, in detail</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq" open>
        <summary>What exactly is paid in FirmLedger?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Two things. (1) <b>Viewing</b> the full details of every listing — public websites, emails, phones, social platforms, the events timeline and relationship graph. (2) The <b>perks</b> on listings you own: the blue tick, homepage Featured placement, the premium gold badge and priority review. Adding and editing your listings stays completely free.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Can I see the tick and Featured placement before paying?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Your verified listing always shows in the directory and search for free. The blue verified tick, homepage Featured strip and gold badge are the Pro upgrade — that's the paid layer.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Guests vs accounts — who sees what?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Guests (not logged in) and Free accounts see the basic profile. Pro accounts see everything across every listing — one subscription, site-wide.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>What happens when the subscription runs out?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>The tick, Featured slot and gold badge pause and the profile gracefully returns to the free presentation; nothing is deleted. Your full-details viewing pauses too. Renew any time — new time stacks on what you still have.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>How do payments work?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Checkout runs on PayPal (cards, bank or PayPal balance), in <%= offers.length ? offers[0].currency : 'USD' %>. You are redirected back to FirmLedger and the account activates the instant PayPal confirms. A receipt with your reference lands in the account email.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Is API access included in Pro?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. An active Pro subscription unlocks the <b>Developer API</b> area in your dashboard: up to 3 API keys (shown once, stored hashed), full REST endpoints — <code>GET</code>, <code>POST</code>, <code>PUT</code>, <code>DELETE</code> on the records you own — per-key rate limits with <code>X-RateLimit-*</code> headers, a complete documentation page at <a href="/api/docs">/api/docs</a>, and a live playground that runs real calls against your own data. If Pro lapses, keys answer <code>403 pro_required</code> until you renew — nothing is deleted.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Can someone write a negative review here?<span class="faq-tgl" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>No. FirmLedger is a factual directory — no reviews, ratings or comments. Company profiles are moderated before publishing.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center">
    <h2 class="h-display">Two minutes to verified.</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto 2rem">Ready to unlock everything?</p>
    <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href="<%= user ? '/dashboard/upgrade' : '/register' %>">Create your account — it's free</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/bottom') %>
